# Architecture rule:
# Google Sheets = human-editable operating/control backend.
# Supabase = execution state, cache, audit, queues, health, and application data requiring relational/runtime guarantees.
# External systems are called directly with their provider APIs/tokens. No external workflow/CRM orchestration layer is part of the canonical backend.
